         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Running Among the Numbers\n\nIn our last lessons, we learned to **walk** among the numbers. We discovered two powerful rules:\n\n- The **Additive Identity**: any number added to 0 stays the same, so **a + 0 = a**.\n- The **Commutative Axiom**: the order of the numbers does not matter, so **a + b = b + a**.\n\nIn this lesson, we will deepen our knowledge and learn how to add large numbers, step by step, and discover that there are no secrets—just repetition of simple steps.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
