         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Addition Is a Reconstruction\n\nJust as a temple starts small and grows, an addition starts from the smallest values and moves toward the largest.\nAnd just as temples are built in pairs of layers, addition always happens in **pairs** of numbers: **a + b**, over and over, until we reach the final result.\n\nSo, when you add big numbers, remember the temple: build the result little by little!",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
