               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "687a38b5-de0e-4d16-a4d0-8ec87a545ccb",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=687a38b5-de0e-4d16-a4d0-8ec87a545ccb",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Adding Large Numbers\n\nTo add numbers with more than one digit, we follow a simple and repetitive process:\n\n1. Write the numbers one above the other, lining up the digits by their place value (units under units, tens under tens).\n2. Add the numbers **column by column**, starting from the **rightmost** digit (the units).\n3. Move to the left, one column at a time.\n\nIf a column sum is 9 or less, we simply write it. If it is greater than 9, we keep the unit digit and **carry 1** to the next column.\n\nLet us try it with **654321 + 543210**!",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><svg width=\"480\" height=\"185\" fill=\"none\" font-family=\"monospace\"><text x=\"142\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#E67E22\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><text x=\"286\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"334\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"382\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"108\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">+</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"286\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"334\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"382\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"118\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"118\" stroke=\"#2C3E50\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"142\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#E74C3C\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">9</text><text x=\"286\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><text x=\"334\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><text x=\"382\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#2C3E50\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text></svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Calculation 3</b>: Addition of 654321 and 543210. The small 1 above the columns is the digit we carry to the millions column.</p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
