            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "687a38b5-de0e-4d16-a4d0-8ec87a545ccb",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=687a38b5-de0e-4d16-a4d0-8ec87a545ccb",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nThe secret of adding big numbers is that there is no secret: we simply **repeat the same steps** of adding two digits, column by column, as many times as needed.\n\nSo do not be intimidated by the size of the numbers—you already know how to run among them! And you also learned how the Mesoamerican people built their temples, layer by layer, exactly like we build our results.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
